  "body": "Description of the issue: on Windows, when the external editor is set to \"Gimp\" in the the preferences, ART only searches for Gimp 2 (`gimp-2.%1.exe`), and fails to launch Gimp if it has been updated to Gimp 3.\nGimp 3 can be launched if the \"Custom command line\" is set to `C:\\Program Files\\GIMP 3\\bin\\Gimp-3.0.exe`.\n",
